You missed my entire paragraph about dipping being recommended once you
are powerful enough to easily deal w/ water moccasins, demons, and
nymphs.  You definitely don't try it early on.

But the chance of a wish depends on the DL of the fountain, so once
you've gotten to DL8 (presumably clearing soko and Minetown) and are
pretty tough, but you still lack MR (and fear levelport, polytraps,
golden nagas, and whatever else is about to start showing up), you go
back and try #dipping all the fountains starting at DL1.

At that point, dipping makes you more likely to survive, not less
(because the bad effects aren't anywhere near fatal by then).

Personally I won't even dip for Excalibur until I'm tough enough to
handle the bad outcomes.

